/Title (The investigation determined that the incident was limited to the Windows 10 Pro endpoint assigned to Amin, with no evidence of lateral movement to other systems. Immediate containment and remediation actions were performed to remove persistence, revoke the unauthorized administrative privileges, verify endpoint integrity, and restore the affected system to a secure operational state.)
